    "body": "Blocked while verifying the Step 6 changes for #3344 in `.claude/worktrees/issue-3344` (`issue/3344-contour-do-not-touch`):\n\n- Repeated `camcraft-motion` builds (`gate-logs/test-20261122-111207`, `gate-logs/test-20261122-122537`) hung indefinitely at `Compiling solidcore v1.0.1` (`target/debug/build/solidcore/05aad555e0766d86`) with no progress to `solidcore/05aad555e0766d86/out/` after the earlier `test-20261122-110932` compile failure left partial codegen files there.\n- An external `gate quick` process (`gate-logs/quick-20261122-130619/01-motion_build_--no-run_.log`) now holds `.claude/worktrees/issue-3344/target/debug/.cargo-lock` (stuck on `Compiling solidcore v1.0.1` since 05:55:16), causing every subsequent `cargo` / `cargo xtask` invocation in the worktree to wait on `Blocking waiting for file lock on build directory`.\n- Process inspection (`ps`) is denied by sandbox permissions, so the external lock holder cannot be inspected or cleared.\n\nUnpushed implementation and test edits remain in `.claude/worktrees/issue-3344` (branch `issue/3344-contour-do-not-touch`, unverified post-fix; Step 5 pins failed as expected before the fix). Releasing `claimed`.\n",
